Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,patients who are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,going to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,undergo surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For instance,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,they have back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.36,0:00:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,pain or they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,have something called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,spinal stenosis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're having
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,walking gait problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and then I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,see the patient,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.85,0:00:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,turns out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,they're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,have the surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.19,0:00:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,going to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They have a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,peripheral neuropathy in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,their feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's overlooked,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so the prognosis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,after surgery is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,going to depend
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,on what I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,tell the surgeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,before they do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the surgery.
